    {
      "v": 2,
      "zh": "他为那设立他的尽忠，如同摩西在　神的全家尽忠一样。",
      "en": "who is faithful to the one who appointed him, as Moses was also in God’s[NOTE:1] house.[NOTE:2]",
      "notes": [
        "Grk “his”; in the translation the referent (God) has been specified for clarity.",
